<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82196" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισσό-της</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιττ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισσός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>extravagance, excess</i>, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				10.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μιαιφονιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					77.16
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>pomp</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐν τοῖς βίοις π. καὶ πολυτέλεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					9.10.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in style,
				<i>redundancy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Meth.</u>
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ περισσότητος [κατηγορεῖν</span>],
				<i>ex abundanti</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aps.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				p.223
			</span></i> H. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>eminence, excellence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.94
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κατὰ τὴν τέχνην π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				18.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of numbers,
				<i>unevenness</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτιότης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1004b11
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
